.TH QUARRIES 1 "August 2026" "Quarries 0.8.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
quarries \- private encrypted research workspace with local AI, Hebrew lexical study, gematria, and ephemeris tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B quarries
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Quarries
is a Textual terminal research environment combining an encrypted Archive, local semantic retrieval, a separately locked local AI Watcher, Hebrew/Strong's lexical research, Mispar Gadol gematria, saved Hebrew study lists, and a Swiss Ephemeris Observatory.
.PP
The Observatory performs deterministic local chart calculations and is intentionally not sent to the Watcher.
.SH SECURITY
Quarries uses three independent password gates: application, Archive, and Watcher.
.B Ctrl+L
or
.B Lock All
clears active keys from memory and returns to the application gate.
.SH ARCHIVE
Encrypted Leaves, search/editing, Hebrew-letter substitution, encrypted embeddings, semantic retrieval, and password-encrypted exports.
.SH WATCHER
Normal chat model:
.nf
huihui_ai/qwen3.5-abliterated:4b
.fi
.PP
Reference-context model:
.nf
gemma3:4b
.fi
.SH EMBEDDINGS
Semantic retrieval uses
.B embeddinggemma
and stores model/dimension/index metadata with each chunk.
.SH HEBREW
The Hebrew / Strong's module bundles 8,674 lexical entries and preserves custom glosses, definitions, and notes. Saved words can be exported as CSV.
.SH GEMATRIA
Mispar Gadol calculates live while Hebrew is typed or pasted. Niqqud/cantillation are ignored. Final forms use extended values: ך=500, ם=600, ן=700, ף=800, ץ=900.
.SH OBSERVATORY
Local Swiss Ephemeris calculations include current/event and natal charts, planets, houses, ASC/DSC, MC/IC, aspects, retrograde state, Moon phase, and sunrise/sunset. Observatory is calculation-only.
.SH KEYBOARD
.TP
.B Ctrl+L
Lock all modules.
.TP
.B Ctrl+N
New Leaf.
.TP
.B Ctrl+S
Preserve Leaf.
.TP
.B F6
Copy Hebrew substitution.
.TP
.B F7
Copy RTL 3-4-5.
.TP
.B F8
Copy latest Watcher response.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Q
Quit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/quarries/archive.qry
Primary Quarries database.
.TP
.I ~/Downloads/quarries-hebrew-study-*.csv
Hebrew study exports.
.TP
.I ~/Downloads/quarries-*.qryx
Encrypted Archive exports.
.SH INSTALLATION
Run:
.nf
chmod +x install.sh
./install.sh
.fi
.PP
The installer prefers
.I /usr/local/bin/quarries
and installs this manual under
.I /usr/local/share/man/man1/quarries.1 .
.SH PRIVACY
Do not commit private Archive databases, exports, passwords, or personal records.

.SH GEMATRIA DICTIONARY
The Gematria Dictionary tab provides exact numerical lookup over a structured local reference derived from the supplied gematria PDF.
Entering a value such as 73 retrieves every source section indexed under that value.
Concept search uses SQLite full-text search, and the Related Concepts panel provides local text-similarity recommendations.
Every result displays the source PDF page.
